# The act, or event, of singing [[song]]s.
#: {{ux|en|I sometimes have a quick '''sing''' in the shower.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1982|author=w:Douglas Adams|title=Life, the Universe and Everything|page=55|text=Then all three would go off in search of the first, give it a good talking to and maybe a bit of a '''sing''' as well.}}
