|passage=Some of the young folks asked Mrs. Long could they have a '''sing''' at her home that Sunday afternoon; she readily agreed, telling them to come early, bring their songbooks, and have a good '''sing'''.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Kerry Greenwood|title=Murder and Mendelssohn|location=Sydney|publisher=Allen and Unwin|year=2016|page=287|passage='Ah, yes, Miss Fisher, have you had a nice '''sing'''?'}}
