===Etymology 2===
The etymology of the term is disputed between two versions.<ref name=IBSF-SkeletonHistory>IBSF (International Bobsleigh & Skeleton Federation), [https://web.archive.org/web/20180214094842/http://www.ibsf.org/en/our-sports/skeleton-history "Skeleton history"] (2015)</ref>
* From the sled used, which originally was a bare frame, like a skeleton.<ref name=IBSF-SkeletonHistory/>
* From {{bor|en|no|kjaelke}} {{gloss|a type of ice sled}} through a bad anglicization as "skele".<ref name=IBSF-SkeletonHistory/>

