|year=2004
|author=Susan Westmoreland
|title=The Good Housekeeping Cookbook
|publisher=Hearst Books
|isbn=9781588163981
|page=89
|passage=That way, the heat can circulate under the meat and prevent it from '''simmering''' in its juices.}}
